  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Cameroon 2024 &#x2013; IOM MHPSS Technical Working Group Program Officer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This position is urgently needed as the national MHPSS technical working group, newly created in the context of Cameroon in November 2022, since its inception has had difficulty to function adequately. The TWG is co-chaired by the Ministry of Public Health and IOM. However, at sub-national level (Far North of Cameroon) the technical working group has been running successfully. The support of a surge support expert in MHPSS is important to revitalise the national level group and strengthen the involvement of all stakeholders for better coordination of actions across the country. The need for SBP deployment has been discussed with the IASCIntern gebruikrepresentative Cecile Bizouerne, who is providing technical support for the French-speaking TWGs. The Ministry of Public Health, as the current co-chair of the group at national level, is supportive to bring on board a technical expert (SBP personnel), hosted by IOM.</narrative>
  </description>
